Cell["\<\

Assume uniform distribution between \[Eta]Min and \[Eta]Max == >> stdErr\
\[Theta]=(((\[Eta]Max+\[Eta]Min)/2)/Sqrt[12])*mmToMrad
(\[Eta]Max+\[Eta]Min)/2 <--> \[Eta]Ave\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d79dd962-a1a0-7740-a827-5624ab0e4a84"],

